STATUS: No licensing model has been decided in any approved Design Baseline
document. This file is a safe default (all rights reserved, no open-source
grant) pending an explicit decision from VRTP legal/ownership on:
  - the intended distribution model (fully internal vs. any open-source
    components, e.g. the ontology content or non-regulatory-sensitive tooling)
  - third-party license compatibility for dependencies pulled in under
    apps/web, apps/api, and packages/*
  - copyright/attribution requirements for any regulatory or standards text
    quoted verbatim in generated Safety Case Demonstrations
    (see docs/knowledge-graph/09-regulatory-knowledge-model.md §2 --
    the "Licensing Keys" configuration item in
    docs/implementation-blueprint/09-configuration-management.md §5 already
    anticipates this)

This is not an Architecture Change Request item -- licensing is a legal/
commercial decision, not an architectural one -- but it should be resolved
before any external distribution, contractor onboarding, or open-source
dependency audit is finalized.
